msgctxt "seo_title"
msgid "Kinematic/Kinesthetic"
msgstr "Kinematic/Kinesthetic"

msgctxt "search_description"
msgid ""
"Kinematic/Kinesthetic is an iterative multidisciplinary project exploring the relationship between the body and the machine by using technological innovation as a tool for artistic generation "
"through the development of new assistive technology used by disabled dancers."
msgstr ""
"Kinematic/Kinesthetic est un projet multidisciplinaire et évolutif qui explore les relations entre le corps et la machine. Il s’appuie sur l’innovation technologique comme moteur de création "
"artistique, à travers le développement de nouvelles technologies d’assistance destinées aux danseurs en situation de handicap."

msgctxt "title"
msgid "Kinematic/Kinesthetic"
msgstr "Kinematic/Kinesthetic"

